ss=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">414</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">15</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">借星辰之力浇铸而成的武装，为这把枪矛赋予了前所未有的特性。它既能爆发出恒星一般的能量将敌人瞬间燃却，又能凝天星之力于刃端，贯穿前方的一切阻碍。恰如那闪耀于夜空中的人马之弓矢。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">天星贯虹</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:25秒]发动一次突刺攻击，造成50%攻击力物理伤害。如果击中非无敌/霸体状态的敌人，则发动投技攻击，控制敌人并造成共90%攻击力物理伤害+1,100.0%攻击力的火焰元素伤害；在敌人特定招式期间，武器按钮闪光时，可无视所有条件发动反击投技，控制敌人并造成20%攻击力物理伤害+800.0%攻击力的火焰伤害，不计入冷却时间；</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">使用投技、必杀技或爆发状态攻击可以对目标附加【星尘】，该效果每25秒可以触发一次，【星尘】永久持续但无法叠加。持有该武器的角色使用蓄力攻击可使【星尘】碎裂，触发火焰爆炸对大范围内敌人造成1,900.0%攻击力的火焰元素伤害</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">幻炎矛</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">使用必杀技或爆发状态攻击命中目标时，生成三根光枪扎向敌人，每根光枪造成45.0%攻击力的火焰元素伤害，该效果每5秒可以触发一次。不灭星锚使用时，每次使用必杀技都可生成光枪。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">辉星</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">必杀技或爆发状态攻击造成的火焰元素伤害提高35.0%。触发【星尘】碎裂后，被火焰爆炸命中的敌人受到的火焰元素伤害提高20.0%，持续10秒，重复触发刷新持续时间。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/228/detail\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/27/72350798/2283a801a97aee49b5ef4562e594f3bd_4239773472934872665.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「星枪 主序星」图鉴后任意骑枪蛋池武器</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*50</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*4</span></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22stigmata%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22material%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22list%22%3A%5B%7B%22level%22%3A%2250%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%88%B1%E5%9B%A0%E6%96%AF%E5%9D%A6%E7%8E%AF%E7%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%22%2C%22count%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1274%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E8%B6%85%E5%AF%BC%E9%87%91%E5%B1%9E%E6%B0%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1140%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22count%22%3A9%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22level%22%3A%2255%22%2C%22material