350798/55a402515d410ed832b6d769f5e548b5_5304558133832026636.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>女武神·荣光</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">荣光也可使用，使用时同样需要注意“星尘”的CD。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/72350798/3592ea81955bf9d73f2abe6d513ea83a_4583820210110402257.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">不灭星锚完美的毕业武器，具有极高的面板优势，同时具备火伤、火焰易伤、超高倍率等多重加成，光是武器附带的【星尘】就高达1900%倍率，不过在实战中要留意【星尘】的cd以便每波爆发都能打出【星尘】伤害。不灭星锚使用时，武器主动可用在应对冰律boss二阶段结束打断boss动作从而防止被吹飞，此外一般不用武器主动。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/72350798/3592ea81955bf9d73f2abe6d513ea83a_4583820210110402257.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
